      <Output>
        <StdOut>Given an OpenMOC pin-cell source case from "openmoc/sample/pincell.json"
-&gt; done: OpenMocPinCellNuSigmaFSteps.GivenAnOpenMocPinCellSourceCase("openmoc/sample/pi...") (2.3s)
And an OpenMOC MR transformation "ScaleNuSigmaF" with parameter "factor" set to "1.5"
-&gt; done: OpenMocPinCellNuSigmaFSteps.GivenTheMrTransformation("ScaleNuSigmaF", "factor", "1.5") (0.0s)
When I run source and the generated follow-up through OpenMOC
-&gt; done: OpenMocPinCellNuSigmaFSteps.WhenIRunThroughOpenMoc() (15.0s)
Then the OpenMOC parsed value "k_eff" of the generated follow-up should be greater than the source
-&gt; done: OpenMocPinCellNuSigmaFSteps.ThenTheOpenMocParsedValueShouldBeGreater("k_eff") (0.0s)
And the OpenMOC follow-up k_eff should be at least 1.2 times the source k_eff
-&gt; done: OpenMocPinCellNuSigmaFSteps.ThenFollowUpKeffRatioFloor(1.2) (0.0s)</StdOut>
